ATTACHED TABLE ? Rules on Imposition of Anti-Dumping Duties on Petroleum Resins Originating in China and Taiwan

Suppliers of Goods Subject to Imposition and Anti-Dumping Duty Rates by Supplier (Related to Article 3)

Country of Supply | Supplier and Related Exporters | Anti-Dumping Duty Rate (%)

CHINA
1. The following companies, their related companies, and persons exporting products of those companies ? 3.07%:
   (a) Henghe (Henghe Materials & Science Technology Co., Ltd.);
   (b) Yonghua (Ningbo Yonghua Resin Co., Ltd.);
   (c) Henghe Nanjing [Henghe (Nanjing) Materials Technology Co., Ltd.].
2. The following companies, their related companies, and persons exporting products of those companies ? 3.50%:
   (a) Tianjin Luhua (Tianjin Luhua Hongjin New Material Technology Co., Ltd.);
   (b) Wuhan Luhua (Wuhan Luhua Hongjin New Material Co., Ltd.);
   (c) Zibo Luhua (Zibo Luhua Hongjin New Material Group Co., Ltd.);
   (d) Fujian Luhua (Fujian Fuhua Luhua New Material Co., Ltd.);
   (e) Shanghai Luhua (Shanghai Luhua Chemical Technology Co., Ltd.);
   (f) Qingdao Luhua (Qingdao Yanggu Luhua New Materials Co., Ltd.).
3. Jinhai (Ningbo Jinhai Chenguang Chemical Corporation), its related companies, and persons exporting products of those companies ? 2.26%.
4. All other suppliers ? 3.50%.

TAIWAN
5. The following companies, their related companies, and persons exporting products of those companies ? 7.07%:
   (a) Arochem (Arochem Corporation);
   (b) Yuen Liang (Yuen Liang Industrial & Co., Ltd.).
6. Chuen Huah (Chuen Huah Chemical Co., Ltd.), its related companies, and persons exporting products of those companies ? 18.52%.
7. All other suppliers ? 7.07%.

NOTE: Where a supplier under item 4 or 7 has a special relationship under Article 23 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Customs Act with a supplier under item 1, 2, 3, 5 or 6, the anti-dumping duty rate applicable to that specially related supplier shall apply notwithstanding the anti-dumping duty rate for the item 4 or 7 supplier.

All seven supplier categories, the three lettered Henghe companies, the six lettered Luhua companies, the two lettered Taiwan companies, rates expressed in percent, and the related-party proviso are reproduced from the supplied Korean table. The underlying original HWP/PDF layout has not been independently verified.
